	| Name               | PRO Koroneiki1                       |
	| Email Address      | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Number of Accounts | 1                                    |
	| Status             | UNVERIFIED                           |
	And I should be able to view the contact account with the name "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}" and the following values
	| Name          | Korpro - ${staticProjectName} |
	| Code          | PROKORKORPRO                  |
	| Region        | United States                 |
	| Roles         | Liferay Account Customer Role |
	| Teams         | Korpro - ${staticProjectName} |
	| Teams         | Koroneiki Partner             |
	| Account State | ACTIVE                        |
	And I should not be able to view the Liferay Worker account with the name "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}"
	When I click on the "General" tab
	Then I should be able to view the user form with the following values
