	| Roles         | Liferay Account Customer Role |
	| Teams         | Korpro - ${staticProjectName} |
	| Teams         | Koroneiki Partner             |
	| Account State | CLOSED                        |
	And I should not be able to view the Liferay Worker account with the name "Korpro - ${staticProjectName}"

Scenario: View user with multiple accounts
	Testing the ability to create a contact in Dossiera with multiple accounts and viewing the respective user in the provisioning user details page

	Given I generate several static variables for Provisioning
	And I generate a provisioning company name
	And I generate a provisioning project name
	And I publish a project with no partner RabbitMQ message with routing key "dossiera.provisioning.create" with the following values
